Adaptation of Sailing Canoe Vesper
R. W. Gibson (adapted by Bruce Taylor)
Bruce Taylor
Lines from Gibson's Vesper, as recorded in W.P.Stephens's. Canoe and Boatbuilding for Amateurs. Balanced lug racing rig has been replaced by batwing gunter rig.
